        "title": "Quebras de Linha, Ênfase e Importância",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Às vezes, queremos formatar o texto do HUD do jogo com quebras de linha.</p><p>Por exemplo, este painel de status ficaria muito melhor se <code>Health: 100</code> aparecesse em uma linha, <code>Score: 2500</code> na próxima, e assim por diante.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;h1&gt;Player HUD&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt; Health: 100 Score: 2500 Level: 1 Lives: 3 &lt;/p&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos separar linhas com a ajuda da <strong>tag de quebra de linha</strong>: <code>br</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Score: 2500\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Level: 1 \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lives: 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> é uma <strong>tag vazia</strong>. Tags vazias não têm tag de fechamento e nem conteúdo. Elas também são chamadas de tags auto-fechadas.</p><p>Coloque junto a tag de quebra de linha.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"71\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Score: 2500\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Level: 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Lives: 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Há um elemento para dar ênfase ao texto. Ele o deixa <em>itálico</em>. Ele é chamado de elemento <code>em</code>. Adicione <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Log\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Current objective: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Find the key\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Next area: Forest\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Enemies nearby: 3\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Treasure found: 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para definir textos como importantes, usamos as tags <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. Elas deixam o texto <strong>em negrito</strong>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Combat Alerts\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Incoming hit: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"fireball\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Status: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"LOW HEALTH\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que serve a tag <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Isso dá ênfase ao texto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Adiciona uma quebra de linha</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adiciona uma quebra de linha.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144703,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dessas tags é uma tag vazia ou auto-fechamento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dessas tags dá ênfase ao texto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
